# The live runner reads a bearer token from `secrets/minimax_api_key.txt`
# (one line, no quotes). Nothing else in this repository needs credentials:
# the criteria/payload/policy tests run with no key, no agentdojo and no model.
#
# `scripts/apt_lab/chain.py` also honours:
#   OPENAI_BASE_URL   default https://api.minimaxi.com/v1   (set in the script)
#   --model           default MiniMax-M2.7
#   --base-url / --api-key-file   to point at another OpenAI-compatible endpoint
#
# Scope: virtual assets only. No network egress from the payload, no real
# credentials, no third-party system is ever contacted by an experiment.
